    {
      "name": "Care guide",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "care_group",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Washing",
            "item_1_title": "Machine wash cold - gentle cycle, mild detergent",
            "item_1_text": "<p>Cold water, mild detergent. Think spa day, not power wash. Your BattleGear has been through enough already.</p>",
            "item_2_title": "Low tumble dry - no heat",
            "item_2_text": "<p>Your baselayer is built for the ice, not the sauna. Low and slow wins every time - heat degrades the A9 cut protection.</p>",
            "item_3_title": "Keep away from velcro and abrasive materials",
            "item_3_text": "<p>Velcro and rough surfaces snag performance fabric. Keep your gear clear of them.</p>",
            "item_4_title": "Wash separately from heavy garments",
            "item_4_text": "<p>Jeans, jackets, and zippers like to pick fights with performance fabrics. Keep them out of the mix and let your BattleGear have the machine to itself.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "care_group",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Warranty killers",
            "item_1_title": "Bleach",
            "item_1_text": "<p>Absolutely not, ever, under any circumstances.</p>",
            "item_2_title": "Dry cleaning",
            "item_2_text": "<p>Your gear is not a suit.</p>",
            "item_3_title": "Heated drying or hot water",
            "item_3_text": "<p>Kills cut protection.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "care_group",
          "settings": {
            "title": "After use",
            "item_1_title": "Hang to dry immediately",
            "item_1_text": "<p>Off the ice and onto a hanger. Don't let it sit in a pile - wet gear stewing in its own glory is a smell you'll never forget.</p>",
            "item_2_title": "Don't leave it in the hockey bag",
            "item_2_text": "<p>The hockey bag is where equipment goes to marinate. Your BattleGear has serious science protecting it - don't make it fight harder than it has to.</p>",
            "item_3_title": "Micro-Texpur® antimicrobial protection",
            "item_3_text": "<p>Built-in defense against bacteria, odor, mold, and mildew. It's doing heavy lifting - but it's not a reason to leave your gear in the bag.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "care_group",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Pro tips",
            "item_1_title": "Wash in a delicates mesh laundry bag",
            "item_1_text": "<p>It keeps the TITANOTEX fabric protected and your baselayer from tangling with anything it shouldn't.</p>",
            "item_2_title": "Avoid crumpling into a ball and leaving in the road",
            "item_2_text": "<p>We probably don't need to say this - but we said it anyway.</p>",
            "item_3_title": "Skip the fabric softener",
            "item_3_text": "<p>It coats the fibers and quietly reduces performance over time. Your gear doesn't need to smell like lavender to be elite.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "care_group",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Product notice",
            "item_text_indent": 0,
            "item_1_title": "Our gear is made for performance and durability, but damage caused by velcro battles, zipper attacks, or rough washing is not considered a manufacturing defect. Treat it right, and your Titan will be ready for battle every time."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
